{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f385e818f02da932","name":"Restraining Bolt","source":{"id":"source:reference-f385e818f02da932","title":"Restraining Bolt","revision":18455,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:09:25Z","sha256":"14b47ec515da9db4c20bf23947d8c79ee224ebb5f46dd251e24f6ed79d0fc6bb","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18455","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Restraining%20Bolt&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f385e818f02da932","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Restraining Bolt turns off a Droid's motor impulse without actually shutting down the Droid. The Restraining Bolt is activated with a handheld device called a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Caller"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Caller","referenceId":"reference:5556ae33deec9caf"},". Restraining Bolts must be secured to specific locations on Droids. Attaching or removing a Restraining Bolt is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," and requires a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. A Droid fitted with a Restraining Bolt can't upgrade or improve its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},". A Droid with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heuristic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heuristic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:0c5e1a481742e09b"}," can attempt to remove its own Restraining Bolt as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," with a successful DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," check followed by a successful DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. A Droid that fails the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," check can't attempt to remove the Restraining Bolt again until 24 hours pass.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
